# XBD 4.9 Filenames
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XBD.4.9-filenames.001
anchor     basedefs/V1_chap04.html#4.9
class      required
says       Names that differ only in letter case are different names: Ab,
           aB, AB and ab can be created in one directory, are four files
           with their own data and inode numbers, are each listed once by
           readdir(), and removing one leaves the others.
test       t/001-case-distinct.c
